<title>USA: Unapix Entertainment Inc Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Unapix Entertainment Inc Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended December 31,</p>
<p>						   1996		 1995</p>
<p> Revenue				  $7,184,000	 $5,469,000</p>
<p> Income Before Tax Provision	   537,000	    343,000</p>
<p> Provision for Income Taxes	    214,000	    163,000</p>
<p> Net Income				  323,000	    180,000</p>
<p> Earnings Per Common Share		   .05		  .03</p>
<p>Average Number of Common</p>
<p>  Shares Outstanding		   5,313,000     5,052,000(a)</p>
<p>Note: (a) The earnings per share and number of shares outstanding for the year ended December 31,1995 have been restated to reflect a 5 percent stock dividend paid in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>						  Year Ended December 31,</p>
<p> (Audited)				    1996		  1995</p>
<p> Revenue				$22,413,000	 $18,289,000</p>
<p>Income Before Tax</p>
<p> Provision				  989,000	     950,000</p>
<p>Provision for</p>
<p>  Income Taxes			    400,000		15,000</p>
<p> Net Income				 589,000	 935,000 (a)</p>
<p>Earnings</p>
<p> Per Common Share			     .09	  .22 (a)(b)</p>
<p>Average Number of</p>
<p>  Common Shares Outstanding	 5,268,000     3,599,000 (b)</p>
<p>Note:</p>
<p>(a) Includes $362,000, equal to $.10 per share, in tax credits.</p>
<p>(b) The earnings per share and number of shares outstanding for the year ended December 31,1995 have been restated to reflect a 5 percent stock dividend paid in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
